{"suttaId":"sn1.74","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-i","vriCode":"s0301m.mul","paras":[810,816],"vripara":"74"},"segments":{"sn1.74:0.3":"Vuṭṭhisuttaṃ","sn1.74:1.1":"“Kiṃsu uppatataṃ seṭṭhaṃ, kiṃsu nipatataṃ varaṃ;","sn1.74:1.3":"Kiṃsu pavajamānānaṃ, kiṃsu pavadataṃ varan”ti.","sn1.74:2.1":"“Bījaṃ uppatataṃ seṭṭhaṃ, vuṭṭhi nipatataṃ varā;","sn1.74:2.3":"Gāvo pavajamānānaṃ, putto pavadataṃ varoti.","sn1.74:3.1":"“Vijjā uppatataṃ seṭṭhā, avijjā nipatataṃ varā;","sn1.74:3.3":"Saṅgho pavajamānānaṃ, buddho pavadataṃ varo”ti."},"attha":{"book":"Spk-i","bookName":"Sagāthāvagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0301a.att","from":482,"to":483,"paras":[{"para":482,"vripara":"74","refs":["sn1.74:2"],"lines":["Catutthe <b>bījan</b>ti uppatantānaṃ sattavidhaṃ dhaññabījaṃ seṭṭhaṃ.","Tasmiñhi uggate janapado khemo hoti subhikkho.","<b>Nipatatan</b>ti nipatantānaṃ meghavuṭṭhi seṭṭhā.","Meghavuṭṭhiyañhi sati vividhāni sassāni uppajjanti, janapadā phītā honti khemā subhikkhā.","<b>Pavajamānānan</b>ti jaṅgamānaṃ padasā caramānānaṃ gāvo seṭṭhā.","Tā nissāya hi sattā pañca gorase paribhuñjamānā sukhaṃ viharanti.","<b>Pavadatan</b>ti rājakulamajjhādīsu vadantānaṃ putto varo.","So hi mātāpitūnaṃ anatthāvahaṃ na vadati."],"lineRefs":[["sn1.74:2"],["sn1.74:2"],["sn1.74:2"],["sn1.74:2"],["sn1.74:2"],["sn1.74:2"],["sn1.74:2"],["sn1.74:2"]]},{"para":483,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn1.74:3"],"lines":["<b>Vijjā uppatataṃ seṭṭhā</b>ti purimapañhe kira sutvā samīpe ṭhitā ekā devatā “devate, kasmā tvaṃ etaṃ pañhaṃ dasabalaṃ pucchasi?","Ahaṃ te kathessāmī”ti attano khantiyā laddhiyā pañhaṃ kathesi.","Atha naṃ itarā devatā āha –","“yāva padhaṃsī vadesi devate yāva pagabbhā mukharā, ahaṃ buddhaṃ bhagavantaṃ pucchāmi.","Tvaṃ mayhaṃ kasmā kathesī”ti?","Nivattetvā tadeva pañhaṃ dasabalaṃ pucchi.","Athassā satthā vissajjento <b>vijjā uppatatan</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha <b>vijjā</b>ti catumaggavijjā.","Sā hi uppatamānā sabbākusaladhamme samugghāteti.","Tasmā “uppatataṃ seṭṭhā”ti vuttā.","<b>Avijjā</b>ti vaṭṭamūlakamahāavijjā.","Sā hi nipatantānaṃ osīdantānaṃ varā.","<b>Pavajamānānan</b>ti padasā caramānānaṃ jaṅgamānaṃ anomapuññakkhettabhūto saṅgho varo.","Tañhi tattha tattha disvā pasannacittā sattā sotthiṃ pāpuṇanti.","<b>Buddho</b>ti yādiso putto vā hotu añño vā, yesaṃ kesañci vadamānānaṃ buddho varo.","Tassa hi dhammadesanaṃ āgamma anekasatasahassānaṃ pāṇānaṃ bandhanamokkho hotīti.","Catutthaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["sn1.74:3"],["sn1.74:3"],["sn1.74:3"],["sn1.74:3"],["sn1.74:3"],["sn1.74:3"],["sn1.74:3"],["sn1.74:3"],["sn1.74:3"],["sn1.74:3"],["sn1.74:3"],["sn1.74:3"],["sn1.74:3"],["sn1.74:3"],["sn1.74:3"],["sn1.74:3"],["sn1.74:3"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn1.74:2.1","bījaṃ",0,0],["sn1.74:2.1","nipatataṃ",0,2],["sn1.74:2.3","pavajamānānaṃ",0,4],["sn1.74:2.3","pavadataṃ",0,6],["sn1.74:3.1","vijjā uppatataṃ seṭṭhā",1,0],["sn1.74:3.1","vijjā uppatataṃ",1,6],["sn1.74:3.1","vijjā",1,7],["sn1.74:3.1","avijjā",1,10],["sn1.74:3.3","pavajamānānaṃ",1,12],["sn1.74:3.3","buddho",1,14]]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-i","bookName":"Sagāthāvagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0301t.tik","from":601,"to":601,"paras":[{"para":601,"vripara":"74","refs":["sn1.74:1","sn1.74:2"],"lines":["<b>Uppatantānan</b>ti pathaviṃ bhinditvā uṭṭhahantānaṃ.","“Seṭṭhan”ti vuccamānattā <b>“sattavidhan”</b>ti vuttaṃ, itaresaṃ vā tadanulomato.","<b>Khemo hoti</b> dubbhikkhupaddavābhāvato.","Tenāha <b>“subhikkho”</b>ti.","<b>Nipatantānan</b>ti adhomukhaṃ pavattantānaṃ.","<b>Pavajamānānan</b>ti vajanasīlānaṃ.","Te pana yasmā jaṅgamā nāma honti, na rukkhādayo viya thāvarā, tasmā āha <b>“jaṅgamānan”</b>ti.","<b>Gāvo</b>ti dhenuyo.","Tena mahiṃsādikānampi saṅgaho daṭṭhabbo.","<b>Vadantānan</b>ti uppannaṃ atthaṃ vadantānaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["sn1.74:1"],["sn1.74:1"],["sn1.74:1"],["sn1.74:1"],["sn1.74:1"],["sn1.74:1"],["sn1.74:1"],["sn1.74:2"],["sn1.74:2"],["sn1.74:2"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn1.74:1.3","pavajamānānaṃ",0,5],["sn1.74:2.3","gāvo",0,7]]}}
